; Redline: driving metal, 16 bars in E minor at 168 BPM, loops (about 23 s).
; Sampled instruments (sound/tools/make_samples.py synthesizes them): A lead
; guitar, B rhythm guitar (palm-muted chugs and ringing power chords: each
; sample is a whole chord, so a note transposes it), D drums with a double
; kick. Channel C is left out: Paula channel 2 is the engine. Sound effects
; borrow D, so the drums drop out for a moment then.
#title Redline
#tempo 168
#inst lead samples/lead.wav root=e5 vol=46
#inst chug samples/chug.wav root=e2 vol=54
#inst chord samples/chord.wav root=e2 vol=50
#inst kick samples/kick.wav root=o4c vol=60
#inst snare samples/snare.wav root=o4c vol=52
#inst crash samples/crash.wav root=o4c vol=40

; ---- lead: verse twice (the second an octave up), chorus over C G D Em
A @lead l4
A o4 e4. g8 b4 a8 g8        | o4 f+4 e8 d8 e2
A o4 e4. g8 b4 > d8 < b8    | o4 a4 g8 f+8 e2
A o5 e4. g8 b4 a8 g8        | o5 f+4 e8 d8 e2
A o5 e4. g8 b4 > d8 < b8    | o5 a4 g8 f+8 e2
A o5 g4 e4 g4 a4            | o5 b4. a8 g4 d4
A o5 a4 f+4 a4 b4           | o5 b2. r4
A o6 c4 < b4 g4 e4          | o5 d4 g4 b4 > d4
A o6 d4 c+8 < a8 f+4 a4     | o5 e2 r4 < b4

; ---- rhythm: the riff on palm-muted chugs, then chords ringing into gallops
B l16
B [@chug o2 e e e r e e e r e e g g a a b a | @chug o2 e e e r e e e r c c c c d d d d]4
B [@chord o2 c4 @chug c8 c c c8 c c c8 c8 | @chord o2 g4 @chug g8 g g g8 g g g8 g8]1
B [@chord o2 d4 @chug d8 d d d8 d d d8 d8 | @chord o2 e4 @chug e8 e e e8 e e e8 e8]1
B [@chord o2 c4 @chug c8 c c c8 c c c8 c8 | @chord o2 g4 @chug g8 g g g8 g g g8 g8]1
B [@chord o2 d4 @chug d8 d d d8 d d d8 d8 | @chord o2 e1]1

; ---- drums: double kick 16ths, snare on 2 and 4, a crash every 4 bars
D o4 l16
D [@crash c @kick c c c @snare c @kick c c c c c c c @snare c @kick c c c [@kick c c c c @snare c @kick c c c c c c c @snare c @kick c c c]3]4
